<mart. 8.64.3>	Et solas, puto, tresue quattuorue
<mart. 8.64.4>	Non natalicias habes Kalendas.
<mart. 8.64.5>	Sit uultus tibi leuior licebit
<mart. 8.64.6>	Tritis litoris aridi lapillis,
<mart. 8.64.7>	Sit moro coma nigrior caduco,
<mart. 8.64.8>	Vincas mollitia tremente plumas
<mart. 8.64.9>	Aut massam modo lactis alligati,
<mart. 8.64.10>	Et talis tumor excitet papillas
<mart. 8.64.11>	Qualis cruda uiro puella seruat,
<mart. 8.64.12>	Tu nobis, Clyte, iam senex uideris:
<mart. 8.64.13>	Tam multos quis enim fuisse credat
<mart. 8.64.14>	Natalis Priamiue Nestorisue?
<mart. 8.64.15>	Sit tandem pudor et modus rapinis.
<mart. 8.64.16>	Quod si ludis adhuc semelque nasci
<mart. 8.64.17>	Vno iam tibi non sat est in anno,
<mart. 8.64.18>	Natum te, Clyte, nec semel putabo.
