<mart. 10.92.1>	Marri, quietae cultor et comes uitae,
<mart. 10.92.2>	Quo ciue prisca gloriatur Atina,
<mart. 10.92.3>	Has tibi gemellas barbari decus luci
<mart. 10.92.4>	Commendo pinus ilicesque Faunorum
<mart. 10.92.5>	Et semidocta uilici manu structas
<mart. 10.92.6>	Tonantis aras horridique Siluani,
<mart. 10.92.7>	Quas pinxit agni saepe sanguis aut haedi,
<mart. 10.92.8>	Dominamque sancti uirginem deam templi,
<mart. 10.92.9>	Et quem sororis hospitem uides castae
<mart. 10.92.10>	Martem mearum principem Kalendarum,
<mart. 10.92.11>	Et delicatae laureum nemus Florae,
<mart. 10.92.12>	In quod Priapo persequente confugit.
<mart. 10.92.13>	Hoc omne agelli mite paruuli numen
<mart. 10.92.14>	Seu tu cruore siue ture placabis:
<mart. 10.92.15>	"Vbicumque uester Martialis est", dices,
<mart. 10.92.16>	"Hac ecce mecum dextera litat uobis
<mart. 10.92.17>	Apsens sacerdos; uos putate praesentem
<mart. 10.92.18>	Et date duobus quidquid alter optabit".
<mart. 10.93.1>	Si prior Euganeas, Clemens, Helicaonis oras
